# R5-FG-83 (P10-CFG-003): force LF line endings across the repo.
# Pre-fix Windows clones got CRLF while Vercel CI got LF, producing
# phantom diffs throughout R4 work. `text=auto` lets Git classify
# files as text vs binary; `eol=lf` forces LF on checkout regardless
# of platform.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files Git should never touch line endings on.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
